    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Oh, here''s a chest ! Maybe I can find a flint and steel in it. Crap,
    it''s locked...

    Wait, what are those stands for ? It looks like something
    must be on them. Like a trophee or... maybe a mob head ! I should look around,
    see if I can find anything.'
